sequenceDiagram
    participant ADO as ADO Work Item
    participant Planner as Module 1 - Planning (Claude Sonnet)
    participant SDLC as Module 4 - SDLC Engine
    participant Decomp as Task Decomposition (GPT-mini)
    participant Exec as Subtask Execution (Claude Haiku)
    participant Valid as Module 3 - Validation (FixLoop)
    participant PR as Module 2 - PR Creation

    ADO->>Planner: Fetch Work Item
    Planner->>Planner: Generate Task Plan
    Planner->>SDLC: Send Tasks

    SDLC->>Decomp: Decompose Task
    Decomp->>SDLC: Subtasks

    SDLC->>Exec: Execute Subtask
    Exec->>Exec: Multi-pass Refinement
    Exec->>SDLC: File Edits + Commit

    SDLC->>Valid: Run Build/Test/Lint/Format
    Valid->>Valid: FixLoop (Claude Haiku)
    Valid->>SDLC: Validation Result

    SDLC->>PR: Push Branch
    PR->>PR: Open PR + Enhance Description
    PR->>ADO: Link PR to Work Item
